  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AI acoustic echo cancellation extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. Cancels the far end leaking back through the local speaker in cases the conventional AEC cannot handle — cheap speakers, high volume, a device held close to another. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.SetParameters with che.audio.aiaec.working_mode in the RTC binding.",
